WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.600 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: First click the middle of the game screen to open the menu.

2
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:13.400 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Click Adventure to start, or use the Beginner Level button at the top.

3
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:28.400 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: We're picking plants now. Click a plant card to add it on the left, then click Start.

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.700 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Which plants should I pick?

5
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:39.800 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Take Peashooter, Sunflower and Wall-nut. The Peashooter does the damage.

6
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.200 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: What else? Can I pick anything else?

7
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:54.200 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Add Cherry Bomb, Potato Mine and Chomper. The Cherry Bomb clears the lawn in an emergency.

8
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.900 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Collect this sun first.

9
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.000 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Then what?

10
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.500 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Plant a Sunflower in lane 1, second square.

11
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.500 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Play it for me for five minutes.

12
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.100 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: OK, I'll play for five minutes, then hand it back.

13
00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:15.600 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I'll take it from here.

14
00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:20.800 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: OK, it's yours.

15
00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.800 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Plant Sunflowers all along the second column for me.

16
00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:37.500 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: I couldn't take over this time. Wait until the lawn is ready and let go of the mouse, then hand it to me.

17
00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.400 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Dig up the Sunflower in column 1, row 1.

18
00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.300 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: OK, digging up the first Sunflower in row 1.

19
00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.900 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Dig up that Wall-nut.

20
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.000 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: OK, digging up the Wall-nut.
